        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: Cleveland Cavaliers, Golden State Warriors\n- People: Andre Iguodala, LeBron James, Kyrie Irving, Kevin Love, Deron Williams, Kyle Korver, Stephen Curry, Kevin Durant, Draymond Green, Klay Thompson, David West\n- Events: Cavaliers–Warriors rivalry\n- Organizations: National Basketball Association\n\nFacts:\n- The Cavaliers–Warriors rivalry is an NBA rivalry between the Cleveland Cavaliers and the Golden State Warriors.\n- Andre Iguodala was born on January 28, 1984.\n- Andre Iguodala is an American professional basketball player for the Golden State Warriors in the NBA.\n- Andre Iguodala was an NBA All-Star in 2012 and was named to the NBA All-Defensive Team twice.\n- Andre Iguodala won an NBA championship with the Warriors in 2015 and was named NBA Finals Most Valuable Player.\n- The Cleveland Cavaliers and Golden State Warriors featured 11 NBA All-Stars: LeBron James, Kyrie Irving, Kevin Love, Deron Williams, Kyle Korver, Stephen Curry, Kevin Durant, Draymond Green, Klay Thompson, David West, and Andre Iguodala.",
